    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya nko pöytoghin Aasia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kima Aap pöytoghinto Israel, kïtagh pipö Moap pipö Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichïnuna osiswechoni Aasia pöytoghinto Israel konyi nyo pö parak ompö Samaria, akïkasa nyoman. Kïyonta pich kïpa kïtep Paal Sepup, nyo kile tororöt pö pipö Pilisti nyo kimi Ekron atökunkïtunö nyinte lö ekïsöpöy nyinte ompö kösotyononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïmwochï malaykayanta ECHOTYON werkoyon Eliya nyo pö koro Tispe kïwö kïnyorï pich cho kiyonï Aasia pöytoghinto Samaria kïtep chane lö, “Ompö ne topetekwa wölo mi Paal Sepup nyo le tororöt pö Ekron atetepa lö ekïlïku ne kösotyo pöytoghinto Israel ompöwölo möminye so Tororöt koro Israel? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwochinö pöytoghintononi lö, lentöy ECHOTYON, ‘Melö ingetunonyi pöröyunoni irïwenyi, imeghenyi nyo mötïny!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh Eliya lenyini kömwochï ECHOTYON, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïlonchö pïchay wölo mi pöytoghintonay. Kïtep nyinte pïchay lö, “Ompö ne tomïlonchenökwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï lö, “Kakïtuyeghecha chi nyo kölenchecha omïlonchenö atökemwowunyi lö lentöy ECHOTYON, ‘Kölö ne teyontenanyi pich kïpa kïtep ngal Paal Sepup nyo le tororöt pö Ekron? Ompöwölo kelenyi so möminye Tororöt koro Israel? Kïlenyona nyu melö ingetunonyi pöröyunoni irïwenyi, imeghenyi nyo mötïny!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
