          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyonta ngat pöytoghintonay yetïntö anka nko askarin tömönut mut. Kïpusta kutïngay akupïtyï tawu Eliya akïsagh nyinte lö, “We, chi pö Tororöt, syonchante nko pikachu wey, sörunö söponwecha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyï ye kikuwany ma nyo kingwïna yïm yetïntinechay le odeny nko pikökwa, wölo syonchecha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
